<figure class="gallery__item"><a href="https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.45.jpeg" data-size="1536x2048"><img loading="lazy" src="https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.45-thumbnail.jpeg" alt="" width="768" height="1024"></a></figure>
<figure class="gallery__item"><a href="https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.46.jpeg" data-size="1536x2048"><img loading="lazy" src="https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/privacy_WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-23-at-19.41.46-thumbnail.jpeg" alt="" width="768" height="1024"></a></figure>
<figure class="gallery__item"><a href="https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/PXL_20260423_175117137.MP.jpg" data-size="3072x4080"><img loading="lazy" src="https://www.1stand7thfromescouts.org.uk/media/posts/29/gallery/PXL_20260423_175117137.MP-thumbnail.jpg" alt="" width="768" height="1020"></a></figure>
</div></div>
<p>We first vitisited <a href="https://thegoodheart.uk/">The Good Heart |</a> </p>
<h2 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">Encouraging health and happiness and alleviating loneliness and isolation in Frome by:</span></h2>
<p> </p>
<ul class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text">
<li class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text">Offering free hot drinks and affordable meals in our pay-it-forward cafe​</p>
</li>
<li class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">Hosting a range of ‘wellbeing spaces’, events, and like-minded groups</span></p>
</li>
<li class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">Coordinating the annual Frome Kindness Festival</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
<p>And the Frome food bank <a href="https://fairfrome.org/food-bank/">Food Bank - Fair Frome</a></p>
